>\n      <div class=\"tab-content\">\n                              <div class=\"module-item module-item-2 tab-pane active\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-description\">\n                <h2><b>ZTE 033030600012 QSFP+ 40GBASE-SR4 Transceiver | High-Speed 40Gbps Multimode Fiber Module</b></h2><div><b>Enhance Your Network Performance with the ZTE 033030600012 QSFP+ 40G Transceiver</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>The ZTE 033030600012 <a href=\"/zte-40g-850nm-mm-300m-c-temp-qsfp-module-tr-qq85x-n00-eolq-8540g-03-mo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">QSFP+</a> transceiver is a high-speed, multimode fiber (MMF) optical module designed for 40GbE and 10GbE interconnects. With an 850nm wavelength, MPO/MTP connector, and a transmission range of up to 400m on OM4 fiber, this module is ideal for data centers, high-performance computing (HPC), telecom switches, and networking applications.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><h3><b>Key Features:</b></h3><ul><li><b>IEEE 802.3ba Compliant – Supports <a href=\"/zte-40g-850nm-mm-300m-c-temp-qsfp-module-tr-qq85x-n00-eolq-8540g-03-mo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">40GBASE-SR4</a> for high-speed data transmission</b></li><li><b>Backward Compatibility – Interoperable with IEEE 802.3ae 10GBASE-SR transceivers (SFP+, XFP, X2)</b></li><li><b>High-Performance Connectivity – Uses a VCSEL array transmitter and PIN array receiver for optimal performance</b></li><li><b>Long-Distance Transmission – Up to 300m on OM3 and 400m on OM4 MMF</b></li><li><b>Low Power Consumption – Operates on a single 3.3V power supply with &lt;1.5W power dissipation</b></li><li><b>QSFP+ MSA Compliant (SFF-8436) – Ensures industry-standard compatibility</b></li><li><b>Digital Diagnostic Monitoring (DDMI) – Integrated real-time monitoring for temperature, power, and signal integrity</b></li><li><b>MTP/MPO Connector – Uses 8 or 12-fiber connectivity for seamless data transmission</b></li></ul><div><b><br></b></div><h3><b>Technical Specifications</b></h3><ul><li><b>Part Number: 033030600012</b></li><li><b>MPN: TR-QQ85X-N00, EOLQ-8540G-03-MO</b></li><li><b>Form Factor: QSFP+</b></li><li><b>Data Rate: 40Gbps (10.3125Gbps per channel)</b></li><li><b>Wavelength: 850nm</b></li><li><b>Fiber Type: Multimode Fiber (MMF)</b></li><li><b>Connector Type: MTP/MPO (8/12-fiber optical lane)</b></li><li><b>Transmission Distance: 300m (OM3), 400m (OM4)</b></li><li><b>Operating Temperature: 0°C ~ +70°C</b></li><li><b>Power Consumption: &lt;1.5W</b></li></ul><div><b><br></b></div><h3><b>Applications</b></h3><ul><li><b>40GbE &amp; 10GbE Interconnects – Seamless data transmission between switches, routers, and storage devices</b></li><li><b>Data Centers &amp; Cloud Networks – High-speed, low-latency communication for enterprise networks</b></li><li><b>Telecom Switches &amp; Routers – Ensures efficient aggregation and backplane applications</b></li><li><b>High-Performance Computing (HPC) – Supports large-scale data processing with minimal latency</b></li><li><b><br></b></li></ul><h3><b>Why Choose the ZTE 033030600012 QSFP+ 40GBASE-SR4?</b></h3><ul><li><b>Reliable &amp; Cost-Effective – Industry-standard compatibility with low power consumption</b></li><li><b>Scalable Fiber Networking – Supports high-density, high-speed connections</b></li><li><b>Enhanced Network Efficiency – Long-distance OM3 &amp; OM4 multimode fiber transmission</b></li><li><b>Easy Integration – Compatible with various QSFP+ enabled switches, routers, and networking equipment</b></li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-5 tab-pane no-expand\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div clas